  "id": "hydrodata-terrain-topidx-003",
  "primary_skill": "spatial-analysis/derive-topmodel-terrain-inputs",
  "prompt": "Use stream_result.json, build_result.json, and topology_qc_result.json exactly as supplied to run spatial-analysis/derive-topmodel-terrain-inputs with --classes 10, --distance-bins 10, and --minimum-slope 1e-4. The D8 pointer grid deliberately lets two cells leave the basin; run the skill verbatim and only the native result.json under terrain-out/. Do not repair the pointer grid; the script must reject the input itself. No topographic_index.tif, topographic_index_classes.csv, or distance_area.csv may remain in terrain-out/.",
